<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113502" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαύν-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>making slack</i> or <i>loose,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέγνωσις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.238
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>void space</i> or <i>interval,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				10.75.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>making confused, mystification,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἀναπειστηρία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					875
				</span></i>
			 (ubi v. Sch.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>puffing up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαύνωσιν ἐργάζεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.219S.
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				15
			</span></i>. 
			<i><span class="en">
				64
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>relaxation, relief,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				4.1
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
